      "product-launch-hero-block": {
        "type": "product-launch-hero-block",
        "settings": {
          "block_switch": true,
          "block-title": "YOUR RETINOL SKIN SOLUTION",
          "block-image": "shopify://shop_images/retinol-launch-banner.png",
          "block-text": "Our vision was to create a leading Retinol skin solution, adaptive to all skins. Rejuvenate your skin tone, texture and radiance with our advanced range of Retinol products and treatments. To complete your Retinol evening routine, we are thrilled to be launching the gold standard in our eye care, our NEW Retinol Renewal Eye Serum. Discover how Retinol can work for your skin solution today."
        }
      },
      "product-launch-cta1": {
        "type": "product-launch-cta1",
        "blocks": {
          "52373f15-fc00-4ed5-b7c1-e43804af55d9": {
            "type": "content",
            "settings": {
              "block_col_reverse": false,
              "block-title-sm": "The hero",
              "block-title-big": "Ingredients",
              "block-text": "<p>Our Retinol range has been formulated with a range of active ingredients to support your skin.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Peptides: To strengthen and rebuild</li>    <li>Ceramides: To boost and support skin barrier function as well as hydration levels</li>    <li>Hyaluronic acid: To plump and hydrate</li>    <li>Kakadu plum: To reinforce the skin’s protective barrier</li>    <li>Niacinimide: To smooth the skin and counter any redness</li>    <li>Liquid shea: To intensely hydrate the skin</li>\n</ul>",
              "content-padding-right": 0,
              "block-image": "shopify://shop_images/Retinol-Caraousel-1.jpg",
              "block-video": "",
              "block-button1-text": "",
              "block-button1-url": "",
              "block-button2-text": "",
              "block-button2-url": ""
            }
          },
          "53f13137-6b7e-42eb-8071-a0a8fda54169": {
            "type": "content",
            "settings": {
              "block_col_reverse": true,
              "block-title-sm": "The Gold",
              "block-title-big": "Standard",
              "block-text": "<p>For results you can see, our NEW Retinol Renewal Eye Serum is formulated with 0.3% encapsulated Retinol to specifically hydrate, firm and brighten the delicate eye area of all skin types.</p>",
              "content-padding-right": 215,
              "block-video": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/2999/1646/files/retinol_eye.mp4?v=1645349066",
              "block-inline-image": "shopify://shop_images/retinol-renewal-eye-serum-15ml_1.png",
              "block-button1-text": "",
              "block-button1-url": "",
              "block-button2-text": "",
              "block-button2-url": ""
            }
          },
          "c67f7637-59b9-4740-8960-245995f4e6f7": {
            "type": "content",
            "settings": {
              "block_col_reverse": false,
              "block-title-sm": "The Right",
              "block-title-big": "Retinol",
              "block-text": "<p>A highly active and multi-action Retinol Night Treatment serum, formulated with 0.5% Encapsulated Retinol which assists in achieving a dynamic anti-ageing boost and instantly brighter skin.</p>",
              "content-padding-right": 215,
              "block-image": "shopify://shop_images/retinol-night-treatment-serum-30ml-lifestyle_1.png",
              "block-video": "",
              "block-button1-text": "",
              "block-button1-url": "",
              "block-button2-text": "",
              "block-button2-url": ""
            }
          }
        },
