        "block_order": [
          "84815277-286f-4b30-ad22-30672a74167e",
          "7bdc938a-fa90-43ea-bc6a-6e43e73683c1",
          "2de619e9-0b87-4c7c-b6b9-c64877bd7664",
          "c18a7a57-1c60-419d-8bad-40931ac9e476"
        ],
        "settings": {
          "block_switch": true,
          "block-title-sm": "Your Guide to",
          "block-title-big": "Retinol",
          "block-text": "<p>What is Retinol and how can I incorperate it into my skin ritual? Retinol is an ingredient derived from vitamin A. It’s become an incredibly popular ingredient in anti-ageing skincare due to its almost magical ability to renew the complexion.</p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>Retinisation is the process your skin will go through over 6-8 weeks while building tolerance to Retinol. Regular exfoliation and supporting moisture protective will ensure you see the best results from your Retinol products.</p>"
        }
      },
      "product-how-to": {
        "type": "product-how-to",
        "settings": {
          "block_switch": true,
          "block-title-sm": "How to",
          "block-title-big": "Retinol",
          "block-text": "<p>Learn from our beauty therapists the best tips on how to incorporate retinol into your skin solution.</p>\n<p>Learn from our beauty therapists the best tips on how to incorporate retinol into your skin solution.</p>",
