            "type": "content",
            "settings": {
              "block_col_reverse": false,
              "block-title-sm": "Reawaken My",
              "block-title-big": "Rejuvenation",
              "block-text": "<p>Rejuvenate skin tone, texture and radiance with this advanced treatment featuring a highly concentrated and supercharged Retinol Treatment Mask. The powerful combination of potent Retinol with a Qigong infusion technique, intensely kick starts a dynamic skin result – accelerating an ongoing improvement in skin tone and texture. Advanced treatment featuring a highly concentrated and supercharged Retinol Treatment Mask, formulated with 1% Encapsulated Retinol.</p>",
