              "item_desc": "<font size=\"5\">\n<b>Glow up with Ella Baché\n</b><p>\nWinners will also receive Ella Baché's Spring Skin package including the Radiance Foaming Cleanser, Radiance C Defensive Antioxidant Mist, Neobright Correcting Serum, Neobright  Correcting Day Cream and ultra nourishing Neobright Correcting Night Cream, valued at $500. </p></font>",
